src/tools/regexp/syntax/ (parse.ts, regexp.ts, perl-groups.ts, compile.ts, prog.ts, simplify.ts) is translated from
Go go1.27.2 src/regexp/syntax, src/tools/regexp/ (regexp.ts, exec.ts, onepass.ts) from Go go1.27.2 src/regexp,
test/tools/regexp/ from those packages' tests (with test/tools/regexp/testdata/re2-search.txt and
re2-exhaustive.txt.bz2, RE2 test logs copied from Go's src/regexp/testdata),
src/tools/unicode/ (letter.ts, utf8.ts, and tables.ts generated by scripts/unicode/generate-tables.ts)
from Go go1.27.2 src/unicode and src/unicode/utf8, src/validation/is/go-url.ts from Go go1.27.2 src/net/url,
src/validation/is/go-netip.ts and test/validation/is/go-netip.test.ts from Go go1.27.2 src/net/netip and
src/net/ip.go, the float formatting in src/validation/error.ts from Go go1.27.2 src/internal/strconv,
src/tools/mimetype/mediatype.ts from Go go1.27.2 src/mime, and src/tools/mimetype/go-bytes.ts from Go go1.27.2
src/bytes, src/encoding/binary, src/unicode/utf8 and src/unicode, src/mail/go-mime.ts from Go go1.27.2 src/mime,
src/mime/quotedprintable, src/net/mail, src/net/http/header.go and src/net/textproto, the PLAIN auth in src/mail/smtp.ts
from Go go1.27.2 src/net/smtp, the encoded-word and quoted-printable tables in test/mail/mailer.test.ts from those
packages' tests, src/server/serve-content.ts from Go go1.27.2 src/net/http/fs.go, src/files/image-config.ts from
Go go1.27.2 src/image, src/image/jpeg, src/image/png and src/image/gif, src/files/gif-encode.ts from Go go1.27.2
src/image/gif, src/image/draw, src/image/color/palette and src/compress/lzw (https://github.com/golang/go),
